find: sys::set_keyboard(true); self.device.write(KEYBOARD_ON)?; self.keyboard = true;
replace: sys::set_keyboard(true); self.keyboard = true; self.device.write(KEYBOARD_ON)?;
caught-by:
    cineris-term terminal::tests::a_refused_push_of_the_keyboard_flags_is_not_taken_for_one

[break] the-main-screens-push-is-recorded-before-it-lands
rule: The main screen's push is recorded for the emergency restore only once it has landed, so that a refused one never has the shell's entry popped.
file: crates/cineris-term/src/terminal.rs
in: Terminal::reply
